1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
If you were to make a new structure for the next generation of 18-year-olds that would replace college, what would it look like?

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,760
I actually think what Joel Lineman is doing with Alpha School is really the much better version of what education should look like,

3
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:21,120
which is two hours a day of kind of quote formal study, which is AI tutor driven, which is learning based on the style of learning of the human.

4
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:25,800
And then six hours a day of kind of real life skills and social skills, which are far more applicable.

5
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:30,520
And even in those two hours a day, they advance at twice the speed at 98th percentile.

6
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:33,160
